{"id": "order-items", "system": "Extract the fields as JSON only, with no other text. Use null for anything the text does not say. Keys: order_id (string), items (list of {name, quantity}).", "input": "Order #B-3310: two large pizzas, one garlic bread and 3 colas.", "json_mode": true, "expect": {"schema": {"type": "object", "required": ["order_id", "items"], "properties": {"order_id": {"type": "string"}, "items": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "required": ["name", "quantity"], "properties": {"name": {"type": "string"}, "quantity": {"type": "integer"}}}}}}}}
{"id": "ticket-billing", "system": "Extract the fields as JSON only, with no other text. Use null for anything the text does not say. Keys: category (billing, bug, feature_request, account, other), priority (low, medium, high), product.", "input": "I was charged twice for my Pro plan this month and need the extra charge refunded today.", "json_mode": true, "expect": {"schema": {"type": "object", "required": ["category", "priority", "product"], "properties": {"category": {"enum": ["billing", "bug", "feature_request", "account", "other"]}, "priority": {"enum": ["low", "medium", "high"]}, "product": {"type": ["string", "null"]}}}}}
